-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Save-type database

pkg/pocket/Assets/n64/common/n64savedb.txt is a table of facts about
cartridges (which save chip each has), compiled by tools/build_savedb.py from
public lists; the script holds the address of each list and the file's header
says how each was used. It contains no ROM data.

